{
"markdown": "### NoticeDissolve\n\n**Stunning dust and dissolve effects for iOS 15 - 17.** Brings smooth, artistic particle animations to your notification lists, app icons, and system banners.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/NoticeDissolve/Screenshots/1.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 1"
},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/NoticeDissolve/Screenshots/2.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 2"
},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/NoticeDissolve/Screenshots/3.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 3"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 12,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Notification Dissolve Effect:** Watch notifications, Home Screen icons, and banner alerts disintegrate into smooth particles when cleared or interacted with.\n- **Pre-lock Dust Effect:** Artistic flowing dust particles drift from the left to the right of the screen before locking your device.\n- **Detailed Customization:** Fine-tune animation parameters with sliders from 0.3 to 0.9 seconds.\n- **Broad Compatibility:** Optimized and tested for iOS 15.x - 17.x devices.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
